1
00:00:04,254 --> 00:00:07,214
I'm gonna run to the store.
I'll pick you up when you're done.

2
00:00:07,424 --> 00:00:10,964
(Sheldon:)Okay. I like it a little better
when you stay, but all right.

3
00:00:11,511 --> 00:00:12,801
- Hey, Sheldon.
- Hello.

4
00:00:13,013 --> 00:00:15,343
(Sheldon:)I'm here for my haircut
with Mr. D'Onofrio.

5
00:00:15,557 --> 00:00:18,517
I'm sorry, Uncle Tony is in the hospital.
He's pretty sick.

6
00:00:19,102 --> 00:00:22,392
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear, Mr. D'Onofrio's
in the hospital.

7
00:00:22,605 --> 00:00:25,695
(Sheldon:)Why do these things
always happen to me?

8
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,610
- l can cut it for you.
- You're not Mr. D'Onofrio.

9
00:00:29,821 --> 00:00:31,741
l get my hair cut by Mr. D'Onofrio.

10
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:33,992
(Sheldon:)You believe this guy?

11
00:00:35,035 --> 00:00:36,285
(Leonard:)Excuse us for a second.

12
00:00:36,494 --> 00:00:38,874
(Leonard:)Sheldon, it's okay, he can do it.
He's a barber.

13
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:41,710
(Sheldon:)He's not a barber, he's the nephew.

14
00:00:42,584 --> 00:00:44,044
An example of the nepotism...

15
00:00:44,252 --> 00:00:46,502
(Sheldon:)...that runs rampant
in the barbering industry.

16
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:50,303
(Sheldon:)Besides Mr. D'Onofrio knows exactly
how I like my hair done...

17
00:00:50,508 --> 00:00:53,888
(Sheldon:)...because he has all my haircut records
from my barber in Texas.

18
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:56,011
(Leonard:)What are you talking about?

19
00:00:56,222 --> 00:00:59,472
(Sheldon:)When I first moved here, I was nervous
about finding a new barber...

20
00:00:59,684 --> 00:01:05,024
(Sheldon:)...so my mother had all my haircut
records sent here to Mr. D'Onofrio.

